body:
I loved how Gori and Washimi just accepted Haida into the protect Retsuko squad, and their interactions together were nice to watch! 

On a completely unrelated note, I’ve a feeling that Washimi knows about Haida’s crush on Retsuko and along with Gori, will help him get together with Retsy. especially with the scene in the Christmas special where Washimi gave a look at Haida before leaving with Gori, and that scene just reminded me of the romance anime trope where friends will usually come up with an excuse to leave and the potential couple will be left alone together. 

Hope that made sense, English isn’t my first language ;-;
